217
00:22:19,846 --> 00:22:22,546
追いかけてもうひとつ落っこちた
When I went after it, I dropped another one.

218
00:22:22,546 --> 00:22:24,846
ひとつ分の陽だまりに
There's only enough sun for one,

219
00:22:24,846 --> 00:22:27,546
ひとつだけ残ってる
and only one is left.

220
00:22:27,546 --> 00:22:29,846
心臓が始まった時
As soon as your heart starts beating,

221
00:22:29,846 --> 00:22:32,546
嫌でも人は場所を取る
you take up space, whether you want to or not.

222
00:22:32,546 --> 00:22:34,846
奪われない様に
To prevent it from being stolen,

223
00:22:34,846 --> 00:22:37,046
守り続けてる
you keep protecting it.

224
00:22:37,046 --> 00:22:39,846
汚さずに保ってきた手でも
Even with hands kept clean,

225
00:22:39,846 --> 00:22:42,046
汚れて見えた
they now look dirty.

226
00:22:42,046 --> 00:22:44,246
記憶を疑う前に
Before I can doubt my memories,

227
00:22:44,246 --> 00:22:47,046
記憶に疑われてる
my memories are doubting me.

228
00:22:47,246 --> 00:22:51,546
必ず僕らは出会うだろう
We will meet for sure,

229
00:22:51,546 --> 00:22:56,546
同じ鼓動の音を目印にして
using our heartbeats as signs.

230
00:22:57,046 --> 00:22:59,046
ここに居るよ
I am here,

231
00:22:59,046 --> 00:23:01,846
いつだって呼んでるから
always calling for you,

232
00:23:01,846 --> 00:23:06,046
くたびれた理由が 重なって揺れる時
when the tired old reasons pile up and start to sway,

233
00:23:06,046 --> 00:23:09,546
生まれた意味を知る
that's when you know the reason you were born.

234
00:23:09,846 --> 00:23:14,046
存在が 続く限り 仕方無いから 場所を取る
As long as life exists, we take up space whether we want to or not.

235
00:23:14,046 --> 00:23:19,546
ひとつ分の陽だまりに ふたつは ちょっと入れない
Two can't fit when there's just enough sun for one.

236
00:23:19,846 --> 00:23:22,046
ガラス玉ひとつ 落とされた
A single glass ball fell.

237
00:23:22,046 --> 00:23:24,246
落ちた時 何か弾き出した
And when it did, something shot out.

238
00:23:24,246 --> 00:23:29,046
奪い取った場所で 光を浴びた
It bathed in the light in the spot it stole.

239
00:23:29,046 --> 00:23:31,046
数えた足跡など
Counting my footprints,

240
00:23:31,046 --> 00:23:33,546
気付けば数字でしかない
but at some point it became just a number.

241
00:23:33,546 --> 00:23:36,546
知らなきゃいけない物は
Apparently what I mustn't know

242
00:23:36,546 --> 00:23:39,046
どうやら1と0の間
is between one and zero.

243
00:23:39,246 --> 00:23:43,546
初めて 僕らは出会うだろう
We will meet for the first time,

244
00:23:43,546 --> 00:23:48,546
同じ悲鳴の旗を目印にして
using our screaming flags as signs.

245
00:23:48,846 --> 00:23:53,546
忘れないで いつだって呼んでるから
Don't forget, I'm always calling you,

246
00:23:53,546 --> 00:23:58,546
重ねた理由を 二人で埋める時
when we bury all the piled-up reasons,

247
00:23:58,546 --> 00:24:01,546
約束が交わされる
that's when we'll make a promise.

248
00:24:01,546 --> 00:24:04,046
鏡なんだ 僕ら互いに
We are mirrors, both of us,

249
00:24:04,046 --> 00:24:07,846
それぞれのカルマを 映す為の
reflecting each other's karma.

250
00:24:07,846 --> 00:24:11,546
汚れた手と手で 触れ合って
Our dirty hands will touch,

251
00:24:11,546 --> 00:24:16,046
形が解る
and we'll know its shape.

252
00:24:21,046 --> 00:24:23,046
ここに居るよ
I am here,

253
00:24:23,046 --> 00:24:26,546
確実に触れるよ
and I can touch you.

254
00:24:26,546 --> 00:24:31,046
一人分の陽だまりに 僕らは居る
In this sun that's only enough for one, we are both here.

255
00:24:31,046 --> 00:24:36,046
忘れないで いつだって呼んでるから
Don't forget, I'm always calling you,

256
00:24:36,046 --> 00:24:41,046
同じガラス玉の内側の方から
from the inside of the same glass ball.

257
00:24:41,046 --> 00:24:43,546
そうさ 必ず
Yeah, we will surely

258
00:24:43,546 --> 00:24:46,046
僕らは出会うだろう
meet again.

259
00:24:46,046 --> 00:24:48,546
沈めた理由に 十字架を立てる時
When you build a cross on the sunken reasons,

260
00:24:48,546 --> 00:24:51,546
約束は果たされる
the promise will be fulfilled.

261
00:24:51,546 --> 00:24:56,546
僕らはひとつになる
We will become one.

262
00:25:50,894 --> 00:25:52,294
今日も君は
Today too, without forgetting...

263
00:25:52,294 --> 00:25:53,694
信じること
...to believe...

264
00:25:53,694 --> 00:25:56,594
忘れずに目覚められていますか？
...are you awake?

265
00:25:56,894 --> 00:25:58,294
時が経つと
As time passes,

266
00:25:58,294 --> 00:25:59,694
自分さえも
even your belief in yourself...

267
00:25:59,694 --> 00:26:02,894
信じられなくなる時代のようです
...fades in this kind of era.

268
00:26:03,094 --> 00:26:05,594
自分では気付かないのが
Not noticing it yourself

269
00:26:05,594 --> 00:26:08,294
この症状の特徴で
is the characteristic of this symptom.

270
00:26:08,594 --> 00:26:11,294
