The only prevention method is...

271
00:26:11,294 --> 00:26:14,094
「自分に嘘だけはつかない事」
...to not lie to yourself.

272
00:26:14,894 --> 00:26:17,594
忘れてたまるもんかよ！！
How could I ever forget that?!

273
00:26:17,594 --> 00:26:20,494
僕がボクじゃなくなったら
If I stop being myself,

274
00:26:20,594 --> 00:26:22,094
