458
00:40:35,392 --> 00:40:41,092
この夜が続いて欲しかった
I wanted this night to go on forever

459
00:40:50,092 --> 00:40:54,692
あと何度君と同じ花火を
I wonder how many times I'll be able to watch the same fireworks as you

460
00:40:54,692 --> 00:40:59,092
見られるかなって
with you...

461
00:40:59,892 --> 00:41:04,592
笑う顔に何ができるだろうか
What can I do for the sake of your smiling face?

462
00:41:04,592 --> 00:41:07,592
傷つくこと 喜ぶこと
Feeling hurt, feeling happy...

463
00:41:07,592 --> 00:41:10,892
繰り返す波と情動 焦燥
Repetitive waves and emotions, frustration...

464
00:41:10,892 --> 00:41:14,092
最終列車の音
and the sound of the evening's last train

465
00:41:14,092 --> 00:41:18,092
何度でも言葉にして君を呼ぶよ
Again and again, I'll put it into words, and call to you

466
00:41:18,092 --> 00:41:21,092
波間を選び もう一度
Seeking the pause between waves, I'll try once again...

467
00:41:21,092 --> 00:41:25,092
もう二度と悲しまずに済むように
So that you'll never have to feel sad again

468
00:41:36,892 --> 00:41:42,092
ハッと息を呑めば 消えちゃいそうな光が
A light that seemed it might disappear if we let out a gasp

469
00:41:42,092 --> 00:41:46,592
きっとまだ胸に住んでいた
Surely remained within our hearts

470
