さよならだけの人生か
Is it a life spent saying goodbye?

502
00:44:54,592 --> 00:45:00,092
ほんの少しの未来は見えたのに
Even though I saw a tiny glimpse of the future...

503
00:45:00,140 --> 00:45:01,440
