...even though I saw...

504
00:45:01,440 --> 00:45:05,240
さよならなんだ
it was goodbye.

505
00:45:26,640 --> 00:45:31,840
昔住んでた小さな部屋は
The small room I once lived in...

506
00:45:31,840 --> 00:45:36,740
今は誰かが住んでんだ
...is now occupied by someone else.

507
00:45:36,740 --> 00:45:42,640
君に言われたひどい言葉も
Even the harsh words you said to me,

508
00:45:42,640 --> 00:45:47,440
無駄な気がした毎日も
and the days that felt wasted...

509
