if I could go back to that day...

511
00:45:58,340 --> 00:46:08,140
あの頃の僕にはもう戻れないよ
I can't return to the way I was back then anymore.

512
00:46:08,140 --> 00:46:13,640
たとえばゆるい幸せが
Say, if a gentle happiness...

513
00:46:13,640 --> 00:46:19,340
だらっと続いたとする
...were to drag on lazily...

514
00:46:19,340 --> 00:46:24,640
きっと悪い種が芽を出して
A bad seed would surely sprout...

515
00:46:24,640 --> 00:46:31,140
もうさよならなんだ
...and it'd be goodbye once more.

516
00:46:52,140 --> 00:46:56,940
寒い冬の冷えた缶コーヒー
A cold canned coffee in the freezing winter,

517
00:46:56,940 --> 00:47:01,940
虹色の長いマフラー
and a long, rainbow-colored scarf.

518
