故郷は一層輝いて
More than ever, my hometown shines

599
00:57:36,163 --> 00:57:40,563
ワタリドリの様に今
Right now, like migrating birds,

600
00:57:40,563 --> 00:57:43,763
旅に立つよ
I'll depart on a journey

601
00:57:43,763 --> 00:57:47,463
ありもしないストーリーを
And draw for you a story

602
00:57:47,463 --> 00:57:51,763
描いてみせるよ
That doesn't exist

603
00:57:57,063 --> 00:58:00,963
I wanna fly so far / Away with my guitar

604
00:58:00,963 --> 00:58:04,763
「一人じゃない」って人々は歌う
"I'm not alone," I've heard men and women sing

605
00:58:04,763 --> 00:58:08,363
間違いじゃない 理想論でもない
It's not a mistake, not even an idealistic thought

606
00:58:08,363 --> 00:58:11,363
ただ頼って生きたくはない
I just don't want to live like this anymore

607
00:58:11,363 --> 00:58:18,263
誰も聴いていない 気にも留めない それでも歌い続けた
No one is listening, not even stopping me, still, I continue to sing

608
00:58:18,263 --> 00:58:24,863
傷ついたあなたを 笑わせたいから
Because I want to make you, who has been wounded, smile

609
00:58:24,863 --> 00:58:29,063
追い風 届けるよ
I'll deliver a tailwind to you

610
00:58:29,063 --> 00:58:32,563
僕等 一心に羽ばたいて
Fervently, we'll flap our wings

611
