遠い過去を背負ってた
You, burdened with a distant past

612
00:58:36,263 --> 00:58:40,163
あなたを未来へ運ぶよ
I'll carry you to the future

613
00:58:40,163 --> 00:58:44,363
ワタリドリの様に今
Right now, like migrating birds,

614
00:58:44,363 --> 00:58:47,463
群れをなして
We flock together

615
00:58:47,463 --> 00:58:51,463
大それた四重奏を
Until the day an outrageous quartet

