But we both know that this is for sure / It's not the end of the world / We'll see you one day

619
00:59:29,463 --> 00:59:33,163
追いかけて届くよう
Let's pursue and reach

620
00:59:33,163 --> 00:59:37,163
僕等 一心に羽ばたいて
Fervently, we'll flap our wings

621
00:59:37,163 --> 00:59:40,263
問いかけて嘆いた夜
Ask a question to the grieving night

622
00:59:40,263 --> 00:59:44,163
朝焼け色に染まっていく
We'll go steeped in the colors of the sunrise

623
00:59:44,163 --> 00:59:48,163
ワタリドリの様にいつか
Like a migrating bird,

624
00:59:48,163 --> 00:59:51,363
舞い戻るよ
Come back one day

625
00:59:51,363 --> 00:59:55,463
ありもしないストーリーを
A story that doesn't exist

626
00:59:55,463 --> 00:59:59,163
いつかまた会う日まで
Until we meet again

